<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="794290860"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:46.093"><div begin="19.660" end="58.265" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.660" end="27.798" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.660" end="20.823">晚霞</span><span begin="20.823" end="21.219">灿</span><span begin="21.219" end="21.721">烂</span><span begin="21.721" end="22.852">照着</span><span begin="22.852" end="23.782">我</span> <span begin="23.782" end="24.710">一朵蒲</span><span begin="24.710" end="25.123">公</span><span begin="25.243" end="25.543">英</span><span begin="25.543" end="26.124">飘过</span><span begin="26.124" end="26.427">窗</span><span begin="26.427" end="27.798">口</span></p><p begin="29.009" end="36.803" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.009" end="30.141">就在</span><span begin="30.141" end="30.482">小</span><span begin="30.482" end="32.225">镇的街</span><span begin="32.225" end="33.071">头</span> <span begin="33.071" end="33.966">数着路</span><span begin="33.966" end="34.450">灯</span><span begin="34.549" end="35.716">我一个人</span><span begin="35.716" end="36.803">走</span></p><p begin="37.214" end="41.569" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.214" end="38.342">终究会习</span><span begin="38.342" end="38.948">惯</span><span begin="39.222" end="39.771">这种</span><span begin="39.771" end="40.343">生</span><span begin="40.343" end="41.569">活</span></p><p begin="41.829" end="46.240" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.829" end="42.996">太多的困</span><span begin="42.996" end="43.603">惑</span><span begin="43.603" end="44.141">我</span><span begin="44.141" end="44.408">不</span><span begin="44.408" end="45.066">想</span><span begin="45.066" end="46.240">懂</span></p><p begin="46.438" end="50.906" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.438" end="47.667">就在没有</span><span begin="47.667" end="48.835">月光</span><span begin="48.835" end="49.178">的</span><span begin="49.178" end="49.711">时</span><span begin="49.711" end="50.906">候</span></p><p begin="51.106" end="58.265